Package: blockr.theme
Title: Board-Level Theming for Blockr
Version: 0.0.0.9001
Authors@R:
    person(given = "Christoph",
           family = "Sax",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "christoph@cynkra.com",
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-7192-7044"))
Description: Optional board-level theming for blockr dashboards. Provides
    the scale map: per-variable discrete scales (level to color/shape/
    linetype) carried as a board option and resolved at render time, so the
    same data value renders identically in every view. Includes the map
    constructors, the resolver, a board-level palette, and a sidebar editor.
    Renderers consume the map through a soft dependency; without this
    package they fall back to their standard colors.
